    {"progress_group":"yama_main","default_style":"Slash","description":"Conservative normal-fight state: magic defence is +60 when Yama's target uses Magic; slash defence is +80. This state represents approximately two-thirds of the boss's 2,500 HP. Glyphs, movement, flares, transitions and incoming damage are not simulated.","id":14176,"label":"Phases 1–2","npc_id":14176,"phase":"Phases 1–2, main target","progress_hp":{"Magic":1667,"Melee":1667,"Ranged":1667}},
    {"progress_group":"yama_main","default_style":"Slash","description":"Explicit duo/off-tank state: magic defence is -30 only while Yama's current target is not using Magic. Do not use it for a solo mage. Same boss HP allocation as the conservative P1–2 window; choose one P1–2 state.","id":100010,"label":"Off-tank","npc_id":14176,"phase":"Phases 1–2, non-magic tank","progress_hp":{"Magic":1667,"Melee":1667,"Ranged":1667}},
    {"default_style":"Slash","description":"Normal final phase: increased defence bonuses, +81 magic defence and seven-tick auto-attacks. Represents approximately one-third of 2,500 boss HP. Special attacks, perfect-dodge speed-ups, flare healing and prayer piercing are not simulated.","id":100011,"label":"Final phase","npc_id":14176,"phase":"Phase 3","progress_hp":{"Magic":833,"Melee":833,"Ranged":833}},
    {"cycle":"judge_alternation","default_style":"Magic","description":"Judge of Yama guarantees maximum hits with alternating Magic and melee. Magic attacks first; reactive prayers then require the other style. Use the paired cycle estimate for both intermissions rather than treating one style as an entire kill.","hit_rule":{"allowed_styles":["Melee","Magic"],"always_max":true,"mark_damage":false},"id":14180,"label":"Judge","npc_id":14180,"outgoing_supported":true,"phase":"Judge intermission"},
    {"cycle":"judge_alternation","default_style":"Magic","description":"Judge Magic attacks: guaranteed maximum hit while its reactive prayers allow Magic. The normal fight has two 400-HP intermissions, each starting with Magic then alternating melee. The paired attack-cycle estimate combines both complete gear sets; travel, dodge delay and environmental damage are excluded.","hit_rule":{"allowed_styles":["Magic"],"always_max":true,"mark_damage":false},"id":100012,"label":"Judge · Magic","npc_id":14180,"outgoing_supported":true,"phase":"Judge Magic windows","progress_hp":{"Magic":400}},
